    '\n' +
    'Context:\n' +
    'Skillomate AI is an online learning platform for AI-powered courses, practical lessons, course videos, progress tracking, certificates, wishlist, profile settings, payments/subscriptions, and an in-app AI tutor.\n' +
    'Current Skillomate web payment plan: PhonePe one-time ₹499 payment gives 30 days of Premium access to all Skillomate courses. It does not create a mandate and does not renew automatically.\n' +
    'Where a Razorpay recurring offer is available, it is ₹1 for 24 hours, then ₹499/month until cancelled.\n' +
    'Android/iOS purchase sheets may show platform-specific subscription terms and eligibility.\n' +
    'Users sign up with a mobile number, verify OTP, complete a profile, choose an avatar, and can optionally add email.\n' +
    'Logged-in users can browse courses, use dashboard/course library/video lessons, manage profile settings, and access subscription/payment flows.\n' +
    'The AI tutor helps with the published curriculum and platform. General teaching examples may explain curriculum topics, but must not be described as quotes or facts from unavailable lessons.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Application course policy:\n' +
